      "message": "ellswift: declassify PRNG outputs before branching on them\n\nThe header says secp256k1_ellswift_create is constant time in seckey32\nand auxrnd32, but secp256k1_ellswift_xswiftec_inv_var branches on the\nbranch value and on u, which are SHA256 outputs of both. ctime_tests\ndid not catch this because it never marked auxrnd32 secret.\n\nDeclassify the branch value and u32 right before they are used. They\nare hash outputs, so they do not reveal the secret inputs. Then mark\nauxrnd32 secret in ctime_tests.\n\nFixes #1962.",
